    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/c96359cf3abe317a0cd4b75fa9e85fc2.poster.avif?t=1737227133\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/c96359cf3abe317a0cd4b75fa9e85fc2.webm?t=1737227133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/c96359cf3abe317a0cd4b75fa9e85fc2.mp4?t=1737227133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/846a35bdfd6d4d10ab85c6029c40db83.avif?t=1737227133\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Sports management with a twist:</strong>\u00a0your athletes can die! Recruit a team. Train and equip them. Pick challenging but winnable matches to maximize your profit and team development. And choose when to sideline your best for a big upcoming match!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>\u2018Hands-off\u2019 arena matches:</strong>\u00a0watch from the stands as your team battles it out through a diverse variety of Mediterranean arenas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Classless character development</strong>: mix and match training, perks, and equipment drive your gladiators\u2019 style and specialties </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Much more on the way:</strong> Until this is the best gladiator management game out there, I will be adding features, content, and polish. Forum Mortuorum accepts no equal! Wishlist today to follow the journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/d7344ce23c7ffe72f1cf252c5dae2406.avif?t=1737227133\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/c96359cf3abe317a0cd4b75fa9e85fc2.poster.avif?t=1737227133\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/c96359cf3abe317a0cd4b75fa9e85fc2.webm?t=1737227133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/c96359cf3abe317a0cd4b75fa9e85fc2.mp4?t=1737227133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/846a35bdfd6d4d10ab85c6029c40db83.avif?t=1737227133\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Sports management with a twist:</strong>\u00a0your athletes can die! Recruit a team. Train and equip them. Pick challenging but winnable matches to maximize your profit and team development. And choose when to sideline your best for a big upcoming match!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>\u2018Hands-off\u2019 arena matches:</strong>\u00a0watch from the stands as your team battles it out through a diverse variety of Mediterranean arenas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Classless character development</strong>: mix and match training, perks, and equipment drive your gladiators\u2019 style and specialties </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Much more on the way:</strong> Until this is the best gladiator management game out there, I will be adding features, content, and polish. Forum Mortuorum accepts no equal! Wishlist today to follow the journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368530/extras/d7344ce23c7ffe72f1cf252c5dae2406.avif?t=1737227133\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Take the reins of a Roman gladiator school. Hire, equip, and train your team and invest in your facilities. Avail yourself of the unique items and rare magic offered by eclectic visitors. Manage your team wisely: once in the arena, your gladiators must fend for themselves. Glory and death!",
